# Working memory

Agents update this file. It is the living snapshot of the project.

## Status

- **Status:** active
- **Updated:** 2026-10-11

## Project

- **Name:** Crypto-Trader
- **Purpose:** Paper-by-default Robinhood crypto day-trader. Coinbase OHLC for indicators in both modes; Robinhood v2 quotes for fills/exits. Self-hosted FastAPI UI + Docker.
- **Stack:** Python 3.12, FastAPI/Uvicorn, SQLite WAL, official Robinhood Crypto API v2 (httpx + PyNaCl), Coinbase Exchange public candles, Jinja UI
- **Package manager:** uv (app) + npm (verify scripts)
- **Deploy target:** local Docker / Tailscale VM (not a public SaaS)

## Current focus

- Operator UI: dashboard + full trade blotter + admin (risk, stop/target, flatten, resets).

